&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Workflows are defined, standardized, and followed; throughput and on-time delivery have moved with data to prove it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
