&lt;li&gt;Creation of content in a variety of formats to be used across different channels (paid media, organic social media, out-of-home,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute motion graphics and animations that enhance brand storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modification of the content based on internal and client feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Storytelling skills to bring the content to life, working from a script and a storyboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Edit and produce high-end video content for campaigns across multiple platforms (TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work both with stock footage and in-house material.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch and present ideas and solutions to a creative brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research of new content formats, tools, and references to enhance the outcomes of the creative team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire and motivate the team through continuously sharing inspiration and ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimize workflows, identifying areas where AI can accelerate processes and expand creative possibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position will be hybrid and based in Buenos Aires.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of Adobe Creative Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of digital marketing, Social Media, and the main formats and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative vision with the ability to merge storytelling, design, and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in video editing and motion graphics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High English proficiency (C1 or higher)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agency environment and familiarity with the creative processes involving clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing small teams is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with generative video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to accept constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player with a collaborative attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culturally sensitive and aware of trends in media, art, and design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in 3D or knowledge in spatial and retail design is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please include your portfolio when applying for this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
