ivp-taxbit:greenhouse:5992277004.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by CPAs, tax attorneys, and engineers, Taxbit is the leading innovator automating global tax reporting for the digital economy. Taxbit&#39;s AI-enabled platform streamlines compliance related to digital assets, payments, and other financial transactions. Its unique combination of deep subject matter expertise and AI-forward technology have made it a fast-growing disruptor trusted by the world&#39;s leading fintechs, marketplaces, digital asset players, Big 4 accounting firms, traditional enterprises, and government agencies. Backed by top-tier Silicon Valley VCs, Taxbit&#39;s team is located across offices in San Francisco, New York, Seattle, Salt Lake City, London, Madrid, and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity for Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled Subject Matter Expert (SME) in Information Reporting to serve as the bridge between complex tax regulations and our commercial success. This is a multi-disciplinary role where you will act as the &quot;technical brain&quot; for our Go-To-Market (GTM) team, a strategic advisor for Client Implementations, and a core logic architect for our Automatic Exchange of Information (AEOI) product suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate possesses deep domain expertise in IRS Chapter 3 &amp;amp; 4 (FATCA), CRS, CARF, and domestic information reporting (1099/1042-S series), with the ability to translate these requirements into actionable product logic and winning sales narratives.&amp;nbsp;Help us build the future of AI-powered compliance, automation, and operational excellence in an industry where precision matters.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a SME Tax Manager, you’ll be a member of Taxbit’s Subject Matter Expert (SME) team. This role is based in Madrid. Candidates must be legally authorized to work in Spain or another European Union country without company-sponsored visa support (e.g., holders of a valid Residency and Work Visa or Permanent Resident status).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.&lt;/strong&gt; Go-To-Market &amp;amp; Commercial Strategy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with our sales and business development team to execute the go to market expansion strategy, developing enablement materials and providing the necessary tax subject matter expertise training for new regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with prospects, with particular focus on accelerating or expanding the largest and/or most strategic deals for Taxbit qualifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Marketing to produce white papers, webinars, and thought-leadership content regarding regulatory shifts (e.g., CARF, 1099-DA, or changes to DAC7).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitor the regulatory landscape to identify market gaps and help position our product as the premier solution for compliance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. Client Success &amp;amp; Implementations&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Operations to drive engagements and implementations of the Tax Enterprise Platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide customer and internal support during peak filing seasons, troubleshooting complex filing errors and interpreting IRS/Global jurisdiction schemas.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct workshops for the Customer Success team to level up their understanding of withholding and reporting nuances.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of our customers and their business, processes, and products through proactive communication and in depth discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Taxbit Engineering and Product teams to ensure accuracy of data integration and completeness of client data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;3. Product Logic &amp;amp; AEOI Development&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support our Product Team by defining and documenting business requirements for our AEOI (FATCA/CRS) engine, ensuring the software correctly handles the rules and output.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product Managers to prioritize features based on upcoming regulatory deadlines and global reporting changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate that product outputs (Forms 1099, 1042-S, and XML files) meet the rigorous standards of global tax authorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; native fluency in a main European language; preferred business-level proficiency in 1-2 additional languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of identifying opportunities to build, test, and scale AI-powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sees AI as a force multiplier and actively looks for ways to enhance team performance through innovation &amp;amp; curiosity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years of income tax experience working in public accounting or industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in accounting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPA certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational and management skills; ability to juggle multiple projects&amp;nbsp; and disparate information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinker with strong analytical and problem-solving skills; high attention to detail and thoroughness in approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player who is eager to roll up their sleeves and contribute from day 1; brings a great attitude, work-ethic, and eagerness to learn and develop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data and various data analysis tools in order to organize and normalize data for solution development; proficiency with Excel is a must and working knowledge of SQL, VBA, and business intelligence tools like Alteryx is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ready to identify and perform job functions with minimal supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong desire to keep up with emerging issues, news, and best practices within the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aptitude to learn new industry skill sets; primarily digital assets, accounting, and finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is €62,000 – €120,000. Certain roles may be eligible for incentive compensation, equity, and benefits. Actual compensation will vary depending on various job-related factors, including, but not limited to location, experience, level, and job qualifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empresa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fundada por contables públicos (CPA), abogados fiscalistas e ingenieros, Taxbit es la empresa líder en innovación dedicada a automatizar la información fiscal global para la economía digital. La plataforma de Taxbit, impulsada por inteligencia artificial, agiliza el cumplimiento normativo relacionado con activos digitales, pagos y otras transacciones financieras. Su combinación única de profundo conocimiento especializado y tecnología avanzada de IA la han convertido en una entidad disruptiva de rápido crecimiento, en la que confían las principales empresas &lt;em&gt;fintech&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;marketplaces&lt;/em&gt; y actores del sector de activos digitales del mundo, así como las &quot;Big 4&quot;, empresas tradicionales y agencias gubernamentales. Respaldada por fondos de capital riesgo de primer nivel de Silicon Valley, el equipo de Taxbit trabaja desde sus oficinas en San Francisco, Nueva York, Seattle, Salt Lake City, Londres, Madrid y Singapur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oportunidad de impacto&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Estamos buscando un Experto en la Materia (SME) altamente cualificado en Información Fiscal para actuar como puente entre las complejas normativas tributarias y nuestro éxito comercial. Este es un rpapel multidisciplinar en el que actuarás como el &quot;cerebro técnico&quot; para nuestro equipo de Go-To-Market (GTM), asesor estratégico para Implementaciones de Clientes y arquitecto de lógica central para nuestra suite de productos de Intercambio Automático de Información (AEOI).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;El candidato ideal posee una profunda experiencia de dominio en DAC6, DAC7, DAC8, el Marco de Información de Cripto Activos (CARF), el Estándar Común de Reporte (CRS) y normativas de retención locales, con la capacidad de traducir estos requisitos en lógica de producto accionable y narrativas de ventas ganadoras.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Como Gerente de Impuestos SME, serás miembro del equipo de expertos de Taxbit. Este puesto tiene su base en Madrid. Los candidatos deben estar legalmente autorizados para trabajar en España o en otro país de la Unión Europea sin necesidad de patrocinio de visado por parte de la empresa (ej. titulares de un permiso de residencia y trabajo válido o estatus de residente permanente).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilidades principales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;1. Estrategia Comercial y Go-To-Market&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colaborar directamente con el equipo de ventas y desarrollo de negocio para ejecutar la estrategia de expansión en el mercado, desarrollando materiales de capacitación y proporcionando formación técnica en materia fiscal sobre nuevas regulaciones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interactuar directamente con clientes potenciales, con especial enfoque en acelerar o expandir los acuerdos más estratégicos para las cualificaciones de Taxbit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asociarse con el equipo de Marketing para producir informes técnicos (&lt;em&gt;white papers&lt;/em&gt;), webinarios, y contenido de liderazgo de opinión sobre cambios regulatorios (ej. CARF o actualizaciones de la Ley General Tributaria).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitorizar el panorama regulatorio para identificar brechas en el mercado y posicionar nuestro producto como la solución líder en cumplimiento normativo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. Éxito del Cliente e Implementaciones&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colaborar con Operaciones de Cliente para impulsar las contrataciones e implementaciones de la Plataforma Fiscal Empresarial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brindar soporte interno y al cliente durante las temporadas pico de presentación de impuestos, resolviendo errores complejos y analizando los esquemas de las jurisdicciones globales y de la AEAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Realizar talleres para el equipo de &lt;em&gt;Customer Success&lt;/em&gt; con el fin de elevar su nivel de comprensión sobre los matices de retenciones e informes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desarrollar un conocimiento profundo de nuestros clientes y sus procesos de negocio mediante una comunicación proactiva y un análisis detallado.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabajar con los equipos de Ingeniería y Producto de Taxbit para garantizar la precisión de la integración de datos y la integridad de la información del cliente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;3. Lógica de Producto y Desarrollo AEOI&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apoyar a nuestro equipo de Producto definiendo y documentando los requisitos de negocio para nuestro motor de AEOI (FATCA/CRS/DAC), asegurando que el software gestione correctamente las reglas y los resultados.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabajar estrechamente con los Product Managers para priorizar funcionalidades basadas en los próximos plazos regulatorios y cambios en los informes globales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validar que los resultados del producto (Modelos de la AEAT, archivos XML y reportes internacionales) cumplan con los rigurosos estándares de las autoridades fiscales globales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisitos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluidez en inglés; fluidez nativa en un idioma europeo principal; se valorará positivamente un nivel profesional en 1 o 2 idiomas adicionales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia: Entre 5 y 8 años de experiencia en impuestos directos/indirectos trabajando en auditoría (&lt;em&gt;Big Four&lt;/em&gt;), despachos de abogados o departamentos fiscales internos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formación: Grado en Administración y Dirección de Empresas (ADE), Economía o Derecho.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certificación: Valorable estar colegiado o poseer un Máster en Asesoría Fiscal de una institución de prestigio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Habilidades de Gestión: Capacidad excepcional de organización; habilidad para gestionar múltiples proyectos e información dispar de forma simultánea.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pensamiento Crítico: Analista sólido con gran capacidad para la resolución de problemas; alta atención al detalle y minuciosidad en el enfoque.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actitud: Jugador de equipo con ganas de &quot;remangarse&quot; y contribuir desde el primer día; actitud positiva, ética de trabajo y deseo constante de aprender.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Análisis de Datos: Experiencia trabajando con herramientas de análisis para organizar y normalizar datos; el dominio de Excel es imprescindible y se valorará el conocimiento de SQL, VBA o herramientas de BI como Alteryx.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomía: Capacidad para identificar y realizar funciones laborales con supervisión mínima.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actualización Constante: Fuerte deseo de mantenerse al día con los problemas emergentes y las mejores prácticas del sector (especialmente en activos digitales y fiscalidad tecnológica).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remuneración&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;El rango de salario base para este puesto es de €62,000 – €120,000, Algunos puestos pueden optar a una remuneración variable, acciones de la empresa y beneficios. La compensación final variará en función de diversos factores relacionados con el puesto, incluyendo, entre otros: la ubicación, la experiencia, el nivel y las cualificaciones profesionales.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficios y ventajas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remuneración monetaria competitiva (según experiencia)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acciones de la empresa (RSU)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paquete de beneficios competitivo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan de pensiones moderno&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beneficios de bienestar financiero&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modelo de trabajo híbrido: 3 días en la oficina, 2 días de teletrabajo/flexible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permiso retribuido&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Almuerzos de equipo los lunes, aperitivos y bebidas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Baja por maternidad/paternidad remunerada para el cuidado de su hijo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomía laboral y flexibilidad en la ejecución del trabajo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taxbit in the News&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bybit-collaborates-with-taxbit-to-ensure-seamless-financial-compliance-for-global-and-eu-users-302610053.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Bybit Collaborates with Taxbit to Ensure Seamless Financial Compliance for Global and EU Users&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-expands-global-platform-to-power-carfdac8-compliance-at-scale-302411671.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Expands Global Platform to Power CARF/DAC8 Compliance at Scale&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-unveils-industry-first-global-reporting-platform-bridging-digital-and-traditional-finance-302304125.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Unveils Industry-First Global Reporting Platform, Bridging Digital and Traditional Finance&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-named-to-2024-deloitte-technology-fast-500-list-of-fastest-growing-companies-in-north-america-302313123.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Wins the Digital Banker’s 2025 Digital Assets Award for Best Technology Solution Provider for Digital Assets - Tax &amp;amp; Compliance Automation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-named-to-2024-deloitte-technology-fast-500-list-of-fastest-growing-companies-in-north-america-302313123.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Named to 2024 Deloitte Technology Fast 500™ List of Fastest-Growing Companies in North America&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ffnews.com/newsarticle/paytech/taxbit-appoints-former-oecd-advisor-colby-mangels-as-global-head-of-government-solutions/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Appoints Former OECD Advisor Colby Mangels as Global Head of Government Solutions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.taxbit.com/webinars/unlocking-compliance-at-scale-carf-dac8-reporting-for-digital-asset-platforms/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Unlocking Compliance at Scale: CARF/DAC8 Reporting for Digital Asset Platforms&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimers&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;By submitting an application for this role, you certify that the information contained in the application is correct to the best of your knowledge. You understand that to falsify information is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;grounds for refusing to hire you, or for discharge should you be hired.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For US roles, employment with the Company is at will unless otherwise stated in a written agreement signed by the CEO of the Company.&amp;nbsp; This means that either the Company or the employee can terminate the employment at any time and for any reason, with or without notice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

k1-perfectserve:greenhouse:6016375004.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is PerfectServe?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;PerfectServe is a leading provider of clinical communication and physician scheduling solutions in the health IT space. The company was founded in 1997 and has grown steadily since then, with a notable jump after several major acquisitions were announced in 2019. PerfectServe now has 400+ employees, 30,000+ customers — spanning medical practices, hospitals, and health systems — and $100 million+ in annual revenue.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;PerfectServe’s mission is to accelerate speed to care by optimizing provider schedules and routing communications — including messages, pages, calls, and alerts — to the right place at the right time in any care setting. By facilitating real-time information sharing, building better schedules, and automating important clinical workflows, we believe we can help our customers advance patient care and improve the well-being of their clinicians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leading analyst firms like Gartner® and KLAS Research have consistently validated our approach:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 2026, PerfectServe was named highest in execution and furthest in vision in the Gartner Magic Quadrant™ for Clinical Communication and Collaboration — the clear segment leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PerfectServe also received two Best in KLAS awards in 2026 — one for physician scheduling and another for ambulatory clinical communications. That makes for 11 Best in KLAS awards over the past 9 years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At PerfectServe, you&#39;ll have a unique opportunity to join a collaborative team with decades of experience that finds new ways to delight our customers every day. This involves consistent efforts to stay on the cutting edge of product development, which includes everything from implementing AI in new and existing solutions to brainstorming with customers about novel workflows. But you don&#39;t have to be in product to make in impact — everybody at PerfectServe contributes to important work that moves the business forward.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re looking for a well-established, tech-forward company full of smart people doing meaningful work, you&#39;ve found the right place!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Implementation Consultant I&lt;/strong&gt; is a key member of the Implementation team, contributing to the successful delivery of complex, large‑scale enterprise deployments of the PerfectServe platform. In this role, the consultant works within diverse health systems—including multi‑hospital networks and enterprise physician groups—to support full‑cycle implementation activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is designed for consultants who are ready to expand their project ownership, take the lead on defined workstreams within major deployments, and gain expertise across multiple product platforms based on project needs. Flexibility, adaptability, and a growth mindset are essential as this role evolves toward greater technical depth and project leadership responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprise Deployment &amp;amp; Project Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead assigned workstreams within large-scale enterprise implementations, ensuring deliverables are completed on schedule and aligned with project goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with cross-functional teams to ensure smooth execution across complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support planning and execution of enterprise go-live events, serving as a primary point of contact for designated functional areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Workflow Consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide workflow consulting for physician, clinical, and operational teams.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate and register physicians for PerfectServe programs, designing elegant solutions that meet the system level standards established&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consultation support to physicians with call workflow configuration into the PerfectServe system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop training programs tailored to large health system audiences.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate new clinical users at the hospital pre and post go-live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Execution &amp;amp; Integration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure advanced workflows within complex multi-facility systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with third party systems to integrate solutions into the PerfectServe system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct testing across devices, platforms, and integrated technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Platform Training &amp;amp; Skill Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become trained across multiple PerfectServe platforms based on project needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly acquire new product knowledge for enterprise implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any other duties as needed to effectively perform the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required, engineering or IT related discipline is ideal but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work experience in a customer facing or other service roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communications skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent computer skills using Microsoft Visio (or Lucidchart similarly), Word, Excel (including functions), and PowerPoint. Will be using Lucidchart extensively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embraces change and has a genuine curiosity for healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work closely with peers and team members in a collaborative manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must travel up to 30 - 50% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment, Physical &amp;amp; Other Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires interaction with people and technology while either standing or sitting. In order to best service our customers on the phone, face-to-face, or on the computer, all employees must be able to communicate with or without reasonable accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the assignment, may require ordinary ambulatory skills sufficient to visit other locations; or the ability to stand, walk and manipulate (lift, carry, move) light to medium weights of 10 - 25 pounds. Requires good hand-eye coordination, arm, hand and finger dexterity, including ability to grasp, and visual acuity to use a keyboard, and operate equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PerfectServe is committed to compliance with its obligations under all applicable state and federal laws prohibiting employment discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position description is not designed to cover or contain a comprehensive listing of activities, duties or responsibilities that are required of the employee.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join PerfectServe?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;At PerfectServe, we are transforming healthcare communication and collaboration to help clinicians deliver better care. You’ll work with a dedicated and mission-driven team in an environment that values growth, transparency, and innovation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a salary range of &lt;strong&gt;$60,000-75,000 USD &lt;/strong&gt;per year, with compensation tailored to your background, strengths, and potential to grow within the team. The salary range listed for this role reflects our commitment to pay transparency and is based on market data, internal equity, and the scope of responsibilities. compensation will be determined by a combination of factors, including the candidate’s experience, skills, and the specific team or product area they support. We regularly review compensation across the company to ensure fairness and consistency. If you are a current employee and have questions about how your compensation aligns with our ranges, we encourage you to speak with your manager or People Operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Remote first work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Health, Dental, Vision, Life and Disability Insurance options available day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;401K - with match and immediately vested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;17 company holidays, 2 floating holidays plus competitive paid time off policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Internal Advancement Opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.perfectserve.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.perfectserve.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;PerfectServe&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;offers unified healthcare communication solutions to help physicians, nurses, and care team members provide exceptional patient care. PerfectServe’s cloud-based solutions enhance patient safety and reduce provider burnout by automating workflows, speeding time to treatment, optimizing shift schedules, empowering nurse mobility, and engaging patients in their own care.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

